==Swedish==
{{sv-verb|slå|slår|slog|slagit|slå|slående|slagen}}

===Verb===
'''slå'''

# [[hit]], [[punch]] or [[beat]] (someone); to give a [[blow]].
# [[strike]]; to hit, especially with some kind of tool.
# {{context|of a clock|lang=sv}} strike
#:''Klockan har just '''slagit''' tre''
# [[defeat]]; [[win]] against; to [[beat]]
#:''Hon '''slog''' världsrekordsinnehavaren'' = ''She beat the world record holder''
# [[break]] a [[record]]
#:''Hon har slagit världsrekord!'' = ''She has broken the world record!''

